; `open` declared in a module brought by a plain qualified import — route 3
; of 4 of `reserved_open_direct.ein`'s declaration.
;
; A module illegally defining a reserved name *keeps* it, so the loader
; rejects it at its own line in the module: it is never silently renamed,
; and no macro named `reserved_open_direct.open` exists for this file to
; carry.
(import reserved_open_direct)
